          %h2#idea Idea
          %p
            A
            %em chain homotopy
            is a
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/homotopy"} homotopy
            in a
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/category+of+chain+complexes"} category of chain complexes
            with respect to the standard
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/interval+object+in+chain+complexes"} interval object in chain complexes
          %p
            Sometimes a chain homotopy is called a
            = succeed "." do
              %em homotopy operator
            %a{:href => "Poincare+lemma#Statement"} standard proof
            of the
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Poincar%C3%A9+lemma"} Poincaré lemma
          %h2#definition Definition
          %p
            Let
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
